 "answer": "The default value of `ef_construction` for HNSW indexes in pgvector is **64**.\n\nIt controls the size of the dynamic candidate list used while building the index. Higher values improve recall at the cost of slower index builds. It is set at index creation, for example:\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX ON items USING hnsw (embedding vector_l2_ops) WITH (m = 16, ef_construction = 64);\n```",
